Description: Bluetooth proximity detector for automatic screen lock/unlock
 BlueProximity locks and unlocks your desktop based on the proximity of a
 Bluetooth device (typically a mobile phone). It is compatible with Plasma 6
 and Wayland via loginctl and the freedesktop ScreenSaver D-Bus interface.
